{"task_id": "VIS-001", "question": "请看 Figure 9 的原图：中间区域与左右两侧分别标注了什么？蓝色线条在这两类区域中的排列有何不同？请依据图中的具体标注与形状说明。", "answer": "Figure 9 中左、右两侧均标注为“Crystalline region”（结晶区），中间标注为“Amorphous region”（非晶区）。 [2]\n左右结晶区用绿色虚线框标出，中间非晶区用黄色/橙色虚线框标出。 [2]\n在左右结晶区，蓝色线条以平直、平行且基本水平的方式规则排列。 [2]\n在中间非晶区，蓝色线条呈波浪状、弯曲并相互交错，排列明显更不规则。 [2]", "citations": [{"ref": "[2]", "document_id": "doc_0fcf2a50cfa02d21", "filename": "Li-2020-PFI-refining-aggregation-structure-cellulose.pdf", "page_start": 11, "page_end": 11, "visual_assets": [{"id": "img_59204b906609a1c0cfcc", "document_id": "doc_0fcf2a50cfa02d21", "parent_chunk_id": "chk_aa885c8fecba9a1870fa", "label": "Figure 9", "page": 11, "bbox": [147, 336, 847, 643], "image_path": "visual-assets/7abc37a2c9c66d20b67e228e1566b63630e7369faa7cd074fd1a8a1294d28f59.png", "sha256": "7abc37a2c9c66d20b67e228e1566b63630e7369faa7cd074fd1a8a1294d28f59", "width": 1043, "height": 647, "byte_size": 239666, "kind": "figure"}]}], "generation_inputs": [{"image_count": 4, "images": [{"ref": "[1]", "asset_id": "img_468925894a0c5df4d6a0", "label": "Figure 8", "page": 11, "sha256": "821c91727be309b862532721d461d8e7e1044fdf933c0d44c3c6a7fd8d85453c", "bytes": 78251, "width": 1019, "height": 418}, {"ref": "[2]", "asset_id": "img_59204b906609a1c0cfcc", "label": "Figure 9", "page": 11, "sha256": "7abc37a2c9c66d20b67e228e1566b63630e7369faa7cd074fd1a8a1294d28f59", "bytes": 239666, "width": 1043, "height": 647}, {"ref": "[3]", "asset_id": "img_03d297b96cf3fb22d405", "label": "Table 1", "page": 6, "sha256": "0d0b1804ca2b3efbffa4d7d6bca21f0bdbda0b5cf0e501f15585f127119ac16f", "bytes": 68014, "width": 949, "height": 567}, {"ref": "[3]", "asset_id": "img_6b1648a1bc77413041ab", "label": "Figure 4", "page": 6, "sha256": "3064d126094479f08e581c325eecffe27a4b806377371efe15cf0541f06f51c2", "bytes": 47686, "width": 1016, "height": 413}], "model": "deepseek-flash", "input_modality": "text_and_images"}], "image_http_checks": [{"asset_id": "img_59204b906609a1c0cfcc", "label": "Figure 9", "ref": "[2]", "http_status": 200, "matches_sha256": true}], "latency_ms": 14468, "scored": false}
{"task_id": "VIS-002", "question": "请看 Figure 2 原图：橙色柱和绿色柱分别表示什么？a、b两个子图中它们随打浆转数增加大致如何变化？请区分左右纵轴。", "answer": "图2图例显示，橙色柱表示Drainability，对应左侧纵轴，单位为°SR；绿色柱表示WRV，对应右侧纵轴，单位为%。 [2]\n在a子图（softwood fibers）中，随打浆转数从0增至16000 r，橙色柱在左轴总体由约15 °SR升至约77 °SR，绿色柱在右轴总体由约100%升至约200%。 [2]\n在b子图（hardwood fibers）中，随打浆转数从0增至16000 r，橙色柱在左轴总体由约15 °SR升至约68 °SR，绿色柱在右轴总体由约95%升至约190%。 [2]\na、b两个子图中，橙色柱和绿色柱均随打浆转数增加而增大；由于二者分别使用左、右不同刻度和单位，应各自对照相应纵轴判断，不能直接按柱高相互比较。 [2]", "citations": [{"ref": "[2]", "document_id": "doc_0fcf2a50cfa02d21", "filename": "Li-2020-PFI-refining-aggregation-structure-cellulose.pdf", "page_start": 5, "page_end": 5, "visual_assets": [{"id": "img_417cfb54ab7b96d68fe6", "document_id": "doc_0fcf2a50cfa02d21", "parent_chunk_id": "chk_37e5528e8514af77fea7", "label": "Figure 2", "page": 5, "bbox": [156, 97, 838, 289], "image_path": "visual-assets/66b1cffac612276b192593b474d192742b3beae4322872c315c1f05bf6634799.png", "sha256": "66b1cffac612276b192593b474d192742b3beae4322872c315c1f05bf6634799", "width": 1016, "height": 405, "byte_size": 37600, "kind": "figure"}]}], "generation_inputs": [{"image_count": 4, "images": [{"ref": "[1]", "asset_id": "img_4d26968afd70250008a1", "label": "Figure 1", "page": 4, "sha256": "23c30f4b658542af98fe308feb3f127d46fb12ff3a4ed4660f1156da0db178ab", "bytes": 102178, "width": 1016, "height": 405}, {"ref": "[2]", "asset_id": "img_417cfb54ab7b96d68fe6", "label": "Figure 2", "page": 5, "sha256": "66b1cffac612276b192593b474d192742b3beae4322872c315c1f05bf6634799", "bytes": 37600, "width": 1016, "height": 405}, {"ref": "[4]", "asset_id": "img_f9fabe8bbb14215664e2", "label": "Table 2", "page": 8, "sha256": "307aec81dfbe07db6212f96c7259ebff61ac18bbe952ec2f7d3ba20da427a035", "bytes": 80302, "width": 1004, "height": 546}, {"ref": "[6]", "asset_id": "img_03d297b96cf3fb22d405", "label": "Table 1", "page": 6, "sha256": "0d0b1804ca2b3efbffa4d7d6bca21f0bdbda0b5cf0e501f15585f127119ac16f", "bytes": 68014, "width": 949, "height": 567}], "model": "deepseek-flash", "input_modality": "text_and_images"}], "image_http_checks": [{"asset_id": "img_417cfb54ab7b96d68fe6", "label": "Figure 2", "ref": "[2]", "http_status": 200, "matches_sha256": true}], "latency_ms": 23174, "scored": false}
